## ⚙️ How to Run the Project

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/resume-screening.git
cd resume-screening
2️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

3️⃣ Run the application
python app.py

4️⃣ Open in browser
http://127.0.0.1:5000/
